  "caption": {
    "text": "Part 2 of GRAPHQL OPERATIONS. Most GraphQL bugs are not schema bugs — they are operation bugs. Anonymous queries that vanish from your traces, a mutation you assumed ran in parallel, an omitted variable you meant to send as null. Ten pages on the document itself: queries, mutations, names, variables, fragments, aliases, and the execution pipeline that decides what any of it costs.",
